    values:originalText "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended— (a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (b) \"sub-section (2) of section 14\" and substituting \"sub-section 13 (2)\"; (b) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"sub-section (8) of section 14\" and substituting \"sub-section 13 (9)\"; (c) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"paragraph (d) of that sub-section\" and substituting \"sub-paragraph 13 (9) (d) (ii)\";and (d) by omitting from sub-section (4) \"sub-section (9) of section 14\" and substituting \"sub-section 13 (10)\"." ;
    skos:definition "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended— (a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (b) \"sub-section (2) of section 14\" and substituting \"sub-section 13 (2)\"; (b) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"sub-section (8) of section 14\" and substituting \"sub-section 13 (9)\"; (c) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"paragraph (d) of that sub-section\" and substituting \"sub-paragraph 13 (9) (d) (ii)\";and (d) by omitting from sub-section (4) \"sub-section (9) of section 14\" and substituting \"sub-section 13 (10)\"."@en ;
