concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-24 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24 Section 24"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24 ;
    values:originalText "Sections 34 and 35 of the Principal Act are repealed and the following section is substituted: Posthumous children \"34. (1) A reference in this Act to the status or description of a parent of a person at the time of the person's birth shall, in the case of a parent who died before the birth of the person, be read as a reference to the status or description of the parent at the time of the parent's death. \"(2) Where the death of a parent of a person occurred prior to, and the birth of the person occurred after, the commencement of this section, the status  Australian Citizenship Amendment No. 129, 1984 or description that would have been applicable to the parent by virtue of sub-section (1) if the parent had died after the commencement of the section shall be deemed to be the status or description applicable to the parent at the time of the death of the parent.\". Statement in support of application for certificate of Australian citizenship" ;
    skos:definition "Sections 34 and 35 of the Principal Act are repealed and the following section is substituted: Posthumous children \"34. (1) A reference in this Act to the status or description of a parent of a person at the time of the person's birth shall, in the case of a parent who died before the birth of the person, be read as a reference to the status or description of the parent at the time of the parent's death. \"(2) Where the death of a parent of a person occurred prior to, and the birth of the person occurred after, the commencement of this section, the status  Australian Citizenship Amendment No. 129, 1984 or description that would have been applicable to the parent by virtue of sub-section (1) if the parent had died after the commencement of the section shall be deemed to be the status or description applicable to the parent at the time of the death of the parent.\". Statement in support of application for certificate of Australian citizenship"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2df861d20e6d8e5923f055289ebdf30f3921ef740183a982c767b2a0cb24e7c8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Repeals sections 34 and 35 of the Principal Act, substituting a new section regarding posthumous children." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf, p.18" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-24-norm .
