\" Sub-section 44A (1) (paragraph (a) of the definition of \"prescribed evidentiary certificate\") \"sub-section (2) of this section\" \"sub-section (2)\" Sub-section 44A (1) (paragraph (a) of the definition of \"prescribed evidentiary certificate\") \"sub-section (2) of this section\" \"sub-section (2)\" THE SCHEDULE Section 38 F O R M A L A M E N D M E N T S  Australian Citizenship Amendment No. 129, 1984 SCHEDULE—continued Provision amended Omit— Substitute— Sub-section 44A (1) (paragraph (b) of the definition of \"prescribed evidentiary certificate\") \"(3) of section 11C\" \"1948-1969\" \"11c (3)\" \"1948\" Sub-section 44A (2) \"1948-1969\" \"1948\" Sub-section 44A (8) \"(8) of section 11c\" \"1948-1969\" \"11c (8)\" \"1948\" Paragraph 46A (4) (a) \"(a) and (b) of sub-section (2)\" \"(2) ( a ) a n d ( b ) \" Paragraph 46A (4) (b) \"(c) of sub-section (2)\" \"(2) (c)\" Paragraph 46A (4) (c) \"(d) of sub-section (2)\" \"(2) ( d ) \" Sub-section 46A (5) \"(c) of sub-section (2)\" \"(2) (c)\" Sub-section 46A (7) \"the last preceding sub-section\" \"sub-section (6)\" Sub-section 50 (2) \"the last preceding sub-section\" \"ten\" \"sub-section (1)\" \"10\" NOTE" ;
