concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-26-3-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26(10) January 1949 is registered at an Australian consulate for the purposes of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26-3-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) Sub-section 15 (3) of the amended Act has effect, on and after the commencing day, in relation to a person granted a certificate of Australian citizenship before that day under sub-section 14 (8) of the Principal Act by virtue of being the wife or husband of a person referred to in paragraph 14 (8) (d) of that Act, but who is not, on the commencing day, ah Australian citizen by virtue of section 15 of the Principal Act, as if the reference in that first-mentioned sub-section to sub-section 13 (9) of the amended Act included a reference to sub-section 14 (8) of the Principal Act and as if the reference in  Australian Citizenship Amendment No. 129, 1984 that first-mentioned sub-section to sub-paragraph 13 (9) (d) (ii) of the amended Act included a reference to paragraph 14 (8) (d) of the Principal Act." ;
    skos:definition "(10) Sub-section 15 (3) of the amended Act has effect, on and after the commencing day, in relation to a person granted a certificate of Australian citizenship before that day under sub-section 14 (8) of the Principal Act by virtue of being the wife or husband of a person referred to in paragraph 14 (8) (d) of that Act, but who is not, on the commencing day, ah Australian citizen by virtue of section 15 of the Principal Act, as if the reference in that first-mentioned sub-section to sub-section 13 (9) of the amended Act included a reference to sub-section 14 (8) of the Principal Act and as if the reference in  Australian Citizenship Amendment No. 129, 1984 that first-mentioned sub-section to sub-paragraph 13 (9) (d) (ii) of the amended Act included a reference to paragraph 14 (8) (d) of the Principal Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3b2d1a23e402d04d56cb027289b1faf97bb0ab98760ec596335e7037a8641b17" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-26-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "23"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conditional commencement of sub-section 15 (3) of the amended Act for a person granted a certificate of Australian citizenship before January 1949." ;
