concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-26-3-ss-20 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26(20) January 1949 is registered at an Australian consulate for the purposes of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26-3-ss-20 ;
    values:originalText "(20) A person who, immediately before the commencing day or the day fixed for the purposes of sub-section 2 (2), was, or had ceased to be, an Australian citizen by virtue of a provision of the Principal Act repealed by this Act, does not cease to be, or again become, as the case may be, an Australian citizen by reason of the repeal of that provision but nothing in this sub-section affects the application of section 8 of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Australian Citizenship Amendment No. 129, 1984 Provision amended Omit— Substitute— Sub-section 5 ( 1 ) (paragraph (b) of the definition of \"Australian consulate\") \"the last preceding paragraph\" \"paragraph ( a ) \" Sub-section 5 ( 1 ) (paragraph (b) of the definition of \"Australian consulate\") \"the last preceding paragraph\" \"paragraph ( a ) \" Sub-section 5 ( 1 ) (paragraph (b) of the definition of \"Australian consulate\") \"the last preceding paragraph\" \"paragraph ( a ) \" Paragraph 5 (3) (aa) \"26th January, 1949\" \"(2) and (3) of section 10\" \"26 January 1949\" \" 1 0 ( 2 ) and ( 3 ) \" Paragraph 5 (3) (aa) \"26th January, 1949\" \"(2) and (3) of section 10\" \"26 January 1949\" \" 1 0 ( 2 ) and ( 3 ) \" Sub-section 5 (4) \"sub-section (1) of this section\" \"(1) and (3) of section 2 5 \" \"sub-section ( 1 ) \" \"25 ( l ) a n d ( 3 ) \" Sub-section 5 (4) \"sub-section (1) of this section\" \"(1) and (3) of section 2 5 \" \"sub-section ( 1 ) \" \"25 ( l ) a n d ( 3 ) \" Sub-section 8 ( 1 ) \"26th January, 1949\" \"26 January 1949\" Paragraph 8 (1) (a) \"(1) of section 8\" \" 8 ( 1 ) \" Section 9 \"26th January, 1949\" \"26 January 1949\" Paragraph 18 (6) (a) \"country other than Australia\" \"foreign country\" Section 19 \"country other than Australia\" \"foreign country\" Paragraph 2 3 ( 1 ) (a) \"not of full age\" \", being a child who has not attained the age of 18 years,\" Paragraph 2 3 ( 1 ) (a) \", being a child who has not attained the age of 18 years,\" Paragraph 23 (